        <gr str="517">mother</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE> a <gr str="1121">son </gr>that causeth <gr str="954">shame</gr>, and bringeth <gr str="2659">reproach</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="27">
        <gr str="2308">Cease</gr>, my <gr str="1121">son</gr>, to <gr str="8085">hear </gr>the <gr str="4148">instruction </gr>
